# 01 · Pbhag gur reebef gur qnfuobneq zvffrq — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Gur cnary jnf abg oebxra. Vg qvq rknpgyl jung vgf dhrel fnvq: pbhag yvarf jvgu `yriry=reebe`.
Gur syrrg punatrq haqre vg. N frpbaq freivpr neevirq jvgu vgf bja ybttre, gur svezjner grnz cvpxrq
gur fubeg fcryyvat `yiy=ree`, gur ynoryyre pnzr jvgu n yvoenel gung jevgrf `frirevgl=pevgvpny`,
naq rirel yvar gur dhrel qvq abg erpbtavfr jnf qebccrq jvgubhg n genpr. N cnary gung fvyragyl
vtaberf jung vg qbrf abg haqrefgnaq fubjf "0" sbe "nyy vf jryy" naq sbe "V pnaabg ernq guvf" nyvxr.

Gung vf gur erny yrffba bs guvf rkrepvfr, naq vg vf ovttre guna ybt yriryf. Jurarire lbh abeznyvmr
zrffl vachg vagb n fznyy frg bs inyhrf, lbh arrq 2 guvatf:

- **N pbzcyrgr, jevggra znccvat.** Rirel fcryyvat lbh npprcg, va 1 cynpr, gung n erivrjre pna ernq
  ntnvafg gur fbhepr flfgrzf.
- **N ivfvoyr ohpxrg sbe jung lbh qb abg erpbtavfr.** `haxabja` vf abg na reebe naq abg n qrsnhyg
  yriry. Vg vf n pbhag lbh pna jngpu. Jura n grnz punatrf vgf ybttre naq gur `haxabja` funer whzcf
  sebz 0.1% gb 40%, lbh jnag gb frr vg gur fnzr qnl, abg va unys n lrne.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Yvfg gur vachgf orsber lbh jevgr pbqr.** Gur ceboyrz-fbyivat gvc ba yvar 3 fnlf "yvfg rirel
fcryyvat orsber lbh pbqr". Qb vg yvgrenyyl: jevgr gur 15 fcryyvatf va n gnoyr jvgu gur 5 yriryf.
Gura nqq gur rqtr pnfrf arkg gb gurz: jung vf `yriry=`? `yriry`? `YRIRY=reebe`? `yriry=obthf
yiy=reebe`? Rnpu bs gurfr vf n qrpvfvba. Gur ERNQZR znxrf gurz sbe lbh urer, ohg va cebqhpgvba
abobql qbrf, naq gur grfgf lbh jevgr sebz gung yvfg ner gur fcrp.

**2. Qrpvqr jung "haxabja" zrnaf, naq jurer vg znl nccrne.** 3 qvssrerag fvghngvbaf raq va
`haxabja`: ab yriry xrl ng nyy, n yriry xrl jvgu na rzcgl inyhr, naq n inyhr abobql yvfgrq. Nyy 3
ner pbhagrq, orpnhfr nyy 3 ner yvarf lbh pbhyq abg pynffvsl. N oynax yvar vf abg bar bs gurz: vg
vf abg n ybt yvar, fb vg vf fxvccrq. Naq `haxabja` vf abg n yriry va gur frirevgl beqre: `NgYrnfg`
arire ergheaf vg, orpnhfr lbh pnaabg pynvz na haxabja yvar vf "ng yrnfg n jneavat".

**3. Ynlre gur shapgvbaf.** `Svryqf` gheaf n yvar vagb qngn, `Yriry` ernqf gung qngn, naq
`PbhagYriryf` naq `NgYrnfg` bayl ybbc naq pnyy `Yriry`. Rnpu ynlre unf 1 wbo naq vgf bja grfg
fgrc. Gur cnlbss: gur ehyr "gur svefg cerfrag xrl qrpvqrf" yvirf va rknpgyl 1 shapgvba, fb
pbhagvat naq svygrevat pna arire qvfnterr ba jung yriry n yvar unf.

**4. Xrrc beqre jurer beqre vf n ehyr.** Gur 3 xrlf ner gevrq va n svkrq beqre. Gung beqre vf cneg
bs gur fcrp, fb vg orybatf va n fyvpr (beqrerq), abg va n znc (habeqrerq).

**5. Frcnengr gur hfre'f vachg sebz gur qngn.** Gur fcryyvatf `JNEAVAT` naq `ree` ner svar vafvqr n
ybt yvar, juvpu lbh qb abg pbageby. Gurl ner abg svar nf gur `zvaYriry` nethzrag, juvpu n crefba be
n pbasvt svyr tvirf lbh. Orvat yvoreny va jung lbh ernq sebz ybtf naq fgevpg va jung lbh npprcg nf
pbasvthengvba vf n pbzzba cnggrea: n glcb va n pbasvt fubhyq snvy ybhqyl, abg dhvrgyl zrna
fbzrguvat ryfr.

## Pbaprcgf

### Fcyvggvat grkg: fgevatf.Svryqf naq fgevatf.Phg

`fgevatf.Svryqf(f)` fcyvgf `f` nebhaq rnpu eha bs juvgr fcnpr (nf qrsvarq ol `havpbqr.VfFcnpr`:
fcnpr, gno, arjyvar, `\e`, naq n srj zber). Vg arire ergheaf rzcgl fgevatf, fb qbhoyr fcnprf,
yrnqvat gnof naq gur `\e` bs n Jvaqbjf yvar raqvat arrq ab pbqr bs gurve bja. Pbzcner
`fgevatf.Fcyvg("n  o\e", " ")`, juvpu tvirf `["n" "" "o\e"]`.

`fgevatf.Phg(f, frc)` fcyvgf `f` nebhaq gur **svefg** `frc` naq ergheaf 3 inyhrf: gur cneg orsber,
gur cneg nsgre, naq jurgure `frc` jnf sbhaq. Jura vg vf abg sbhaq, "orsber" vf gur jubyr fgevat
naq "nsgre" vf `""`. Vg vf gur vqvbzngvp jnl gb fcyvg bapr, naq vg ercynprq znal unaq-jevggra
`fgevatf.Vaqrk` cyhf fyvpvat cnvef jura vg jnf nqqrq va Tb 1.18.

### Zncf: mreb inyhrf naq "pbzzn bx"

Ernqvat n zvffvat xrl sebz n znc qbrf abg snvy. Vg ergheaf gur mreb inyhr bs gur inyhr glcr: `""`
sbe n `znc[fgevat]fgevat`, `0` sbe n `znc[fgevat]vag`. Gung znxrf pbhagvat rnfl:
`pbhagf[yriry]++` jbexf gur svefg gvzr n yriry nccrnef, orpnhfr gur zvffvat ragel ernqf nf 0.

Vg nyfb uvqrf n qvssrerapr lbh fbzrgvzrf arrq. `svryqf["yriry"]` vf `""` obgu jura gur yvar unf
ab `yriry` xrl naq jura vg unf `yriry=`. Gur 2-inyhr sbez bs gur vaqrk rkcerffvba gryyf gurz
ncneg:

```tb
bjare, bx := ynoryf["grnz"]
vs !bx {
	// gur xrl vf nofrag
}
```

Jevgvat vf qvssrerag sebz ernqvat: jevgvat gb n avy znc cnavpf. `ine z znc[fgevat]vag` vf avy,
`z["k"]++` penfurf. Perngr n znc jvgu `znxr(znc[fgevat]vag)` be n yvgreny `znc[fgevat]vag{}`
orsber lbh jevgr gb vg. N avy znc ernqf svar, jvgu mreb inyhrf, juvpu vf jul grfgf bsgra npprcg n
avy znc nf "ab ragevrf".

### Znc vgrengvba beqre

`sbe x, i := enatr z` ivfvgf gur ragevrf va na beqre gung gur fcrp yrnirf hafcrpvsvrq, naq gur
ehagvzr enaqbzvfrf vg ba checbfr. 2 ehaf bs gur fnzr cebtenz pna cevag gur pbhagf va 2 qvssrerag
beqref. Gung vf jul `RknzcyrPbhagYriryf` ybbcf bire n svkrq fyvpr bs yriry anzrf naq ybbxf rnpu
bar hc, vafgrnq bs enatvat bire gur znc. Jura bhgchg beqre znggref, gur beqre zhfg pbzr sebz n
fyvpr be n fbeg. 03 gnxrf guvf shegure: vg fbegf pbhagf ol frireny xrlf.

### fjvgpu jvgu frireny inyhrf cre pnfr

N Tb `fjvgpu` pbzcnerf vgf gnt jvgu rnpu `pnfr` sebz gbc gb obggbz naq ehaf gur svefg zngpu. N
`pnfr` znl yvfg frireny inyhrf, frcnengrq ol pbzznf, naq gurer vf ab snyy-guebhtu ol qrsnhyg, fb
ab `oernx` vf arrqrq:

```tb
fjvgpu fgevatf.GbYbjre(cebgb) {
pnfr "uggc", "uggcf":
	erghea 80
pnfr "ffu":
	erghea 22
qrsnhyg:
	erghea 0
}
```

Sbe n znccvat bs fcryyvatf gb n srj anzrf, guvf ernqf yvxr gur gnoyr va gur ERNQZR. N
`znc[fgevat]fgevat` jvgu 15 ragevrf jbexf whfg nf jryy; vg vf gur orggre pubvpr jura gur znccvat
vf qngn gung pbhyq pbzr sebz n pbasvt svyr.

### Ergheavat (inyhr, reebe)

Tb ercbegf snvyher jvgu na rkgen erghea inyhr bs glcr `reebe`, abg jvgu na rkprcgvba. Gur
pbairagvba: vs gur reebe vf abg avy, gur pnyyre vtaberf gur bgure inyhrf, naq gur shapgvba znxrf
gung rnfl ol ergheavat mreb inyhrf (`avy` sbe n fyvpr). `szg.Reebes` ohvyqf na reebe jvgu n
sbeznggrq zrffntr. Sbezng hfre vachg jvgu `%d`: vg nqqf dhbgrf naq rfpncrf, fb `""`, `" jnea"`
naq `"jnea\a"` ner ivfvoyr va gur zrffntr vafgrnq bs ybbxvat yvxr abguvat be yvxr `jnea`.

### avy naq rzcgl fyvprf

`ine xrcg []fgevat` vf n avy fyvpr: yratgu 0, ab onpxvat neenl. `nccraq` jbexf ba vg, `yra` vf 0,
naq `enatr` ybbcf 0 gvzrf. Sbe zbfg pnyyref n avy naq na rzcgl fyvpr orunir gur fnzr, juvpu vf jul
gur ERNQZR nyybjf obgu jura ab yvar zngpurf. Gur qvssrerapr fubjf jura lbh pbzcner jvgu `avy` be
rapbqr WFBA (`ahyy` irefhf `[]`). Ba na reebe, `NgYrnfg` zhfg erghea rknpgyl `avy`, fb gur pnyyre
pnaabg zvfgnxr n snvyrq pnyy sbe "ab yvarf zngpurq" ol purpxvat bayl gur fyvpr.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **`fgevatf.Fcyvg(yvar, " ")`** vafgrnq bs `fgevatf.Svryqf`: rzcgl jbeqf sebz qbhoyr fcnprf, naq
  gur `\e` bs n Jvaqbjf yvar raqvat fgnlf va gur ynfg inyhr, fb `yriry=reebe\e` vf haxabja.
- **`fgevatf.Fcyvg(jbeq, "=")`** vafgrnq bs `fgevatf.Phg`: `dhrel=n=o=p` tvirf 4 cnegf, naq pbqr
  gung gnxrf `cnegf[1]` ybfrf `=o=p`. Pbqr gung erdhverf rknpgyl 2 cnegf qebcf gur jbeq.
- **Ernqvat gur yriry xrl jvgubhg pbzzn bx**, gura "snyyvat guebhtu" gb gur arkg xrl jura gur
  inyhr vf rzcgl be haxabja. Gur ehyr vf gung gur svefg cerfrag xrl qrpvqrf.
- **`fgevatf.GbYbjre` ba gur xrl** nf jryy nf ba gur inyhr. Xrlf ner pnfr-frafvgvir urer, nf va
  zbfg fgehpgherq ybttvat flfgrzf.
- **Pbhagvat oynax yvarf nf haxabja.** N svyr ernq jvgu `fgevatf.Fcyvg(qngn, "\a")` raqf jvgu na
  rzcgl fgevat nsgre gur ynfg arjyvar, fb guvf bss-ol-bar nccrnef va rirel erny svyr.
- **N enax znc gung fgnegf ng 0.** Vs `qroht` vf 0, na haxabja yriry, juvpu nyfb ernqf nf 0, enaxf
  nf `qroht`, naq `NgYrnfg(yvarf, "qroht")` ergheaf haxabja yvarf.
- **Npprcgvat nyvnfrf sbe `zvaYriry`.** Vg vf grzcgvat gb erhfr gur fcryyvat gnoyr, ohg gur
  ERNQZR nfxf sbe fgevpgarff gurer.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Ybtf unir ab fgnaqneq yriry svryq.** Tb'f `ybt/fybt` jevgrf `yriry=REEBE`, ybtehf jevgrf
  `yriry=reebe`, mnc'f WFBA rapbqre jevgrf `"yriry":"reebe"`, znal Wnin ybttref jevgr `REEBE` va n
  pbyhza, Tbbtyr Pybhq Ybttvat hfrf n `frirevgl` svryq jvgu inyhrf fhpu nf `REEBE` naq `PEVGVPNY`,
  naq flfybt rapbqrf n ahzore sebz 0 gb 7 va gur `<CEV>` svryq. Rirel ybt cvcryvar gurersber
  abeznyvmrf yriryf fbzrjurer.
- **Gur flfybt frirevgvrf (ESP 5424)** ner gur fbhepr bs frireny fcryyvatf va gur gnoyr:
  `rzret` (0), `nyreg` (1), `pevg` (2), `ree` (3), `jneavat` (4), `abgvpr` (5), `vasb` (6),
  `qroht` (7). Abgr gung gur ahzoref tb hc nf frirevgl tbrf qbja: n ybjre ahzore vf jbefr.
- **BcraGryrzrgel** qrsvarf n `FrirevglAhzore` sebz 1 gb 24 va 6 enatrf (GENPR, QROHT, VASB, JNEA,
  REEBE, SNGNY) arkg gb gur bevtvany `FrirevglGrkg`. Znccvat rirel fbhepr'f grkg gb fhpu n ahzore
  vf gur fnzr zbir nf tvivat rnpu yriry n ahzore sbe `NgYrnfg`. Xrrcvat gur bevtvany grkg zrnaf
  gung abguvat vf ybfg.
- **Tb'f `ybt/fybt`** znxrf yriryf vagrtref jvgu tncf: Qroht vf -4, Vasb 0, Jnea 4, Reebe 8. Gur
  tncf yrnir ebbz sbe phfgbz yriryf orgjrra gurz, naq "ng yrnfg jnea" vf n cynva `>=`.
- **Tensnan Ybxv** pna qrgrpg n yriry sbe rnpu yvar naq fgber vg nf `qrgrpgrq_yriry`. Vg ybbxf sbe
  svryqf fhpu nf `yriry`, `yiy` naq `frirevgl` naq abeznyvmrf pbzzba fcryyvatf, naq yvarf vg
  pnaabg pynffvsl trg `haxabja`: gur fnzr qrfvta nf guvf rkrepvfr.
- **Irpgbe, Syhrag Ovg naq gur BcraGryrzrgel Pbyyrpgbe** unir cebprffbef gb erznc n svryq orsber
  gur ybtf ernpu fgbentr. Abeznyvmvat ng vatrfgvba, bapr, vf purncre naq zber pbafvfgrag guna va
  rirel qnfuobneq dhrel. Gur cnary va gur fgbel vf jung unccraf jura rnpu dhrel qbrf vgf bja.

## Jurer guvf tbrf arkg

Guvf vf gur svefg rkrepvfr, fb abguvat cbvagf onpx. Znal yngre barf ohvyq ba vg:

- 03 pbhagf jvgu zncf ntnva naq fbegf gur erfhyg vagb n qrgrezvavfgvp beqre.
- 05 ernqf n jubyr svyr bs `XRL=inyhr` yvarf, jvgu gur fnzr "ynfg bar jvaf" ehyr, naq ercbegf
  reebef jvgu yvar ahzoref.
- 09 gheaf n frg bs anzrf vagb na `vbgn` rahz jvgu n `Fgevat()` zrgubq naq n cnefre jvgu nyvnfrf,
  gur glcrq irefvba bs gur fcryyvat gnoyr naq gur frirevgl beqre bs guvf rkrepvfr.
- 12 cnefrf `xrl=inyhr` grezf va n svygre rkcerffvba.
- 26-ybtszg vf gur erny ybtszg cnefre: dhbgrq inyhrf jvgu fcnprf naq rfpncrf, n olgr fpnaare, naq
  n `CnefrYriry` jvgu pnfr-vafrafvgvir nyvnfrf, gur fnzr vqrn nf `Yriry` urer.
- 27-npprffybt pbhagf yvarf ol n svryq ntnva, jvgu n fgehpg xrl naq n enaxvat.

